{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25251","headline":"奉酬忠武李相公见寄 · 李逢吉","name":"奉酬忠武李相公见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直继先朝卫与英，能移孝友作忠贞。\n劒门失险曾缚虎，淮水安流缘斩鲸。\n黄阁碧幢惟是俭，三公二伯未爲荣。\n惠连忽赠池塘句，又遣羸师破胆惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李逢吉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}